Z||000000||JohnnyK||06-24-2001||04:48 PM||||I used to be pretty lenient towards them, but they always hang outside coffee time in massive groups... So anyways, I was out there yesterday, and some guy I knew from about grade one starts talking (his dad always buys him new stuff.. It's pretty annoying.) I guess his dad just bought him a Dodge Dakota yesterday, and he has a mx-6 and bimmer... But anyways, he doesn't know anything abou them, which is what bugs me "The shop is charging me $400 to have control arm bushings done.. Pretty good deal I think" I'm like "What?? The bushings cost $50!! I did them in my car for less than that" But, anyways.. and the other guy (has a cavalier, riced, wing, neon, exhaust, it's annoying.. I'm like "wanna buy a Fiero?" (as a joke) "Ummm.. no".. THen the other guy is like "Does it have a wing? I'll buy it for parts.. I saw this great one that had ground effects and a wing".. agh.. pisses me off.. No point to this thread really, I'm done now.||||reg||1
